              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UFestu wathi: “Nkosi Agripha, nani nonke madoda enikhona lapha kanye nathi, niyayibona le ndoda lonke uquqaba lwabaJuda eyenze kimina ngaye, eJerusalema nalapha, imemeza ngokuthi akufanele aphile futhi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
